Torabo-Studio
Copyright 2026 tak-2025

This product is a modified version ("Torabo-Studio") of ZMK Studio, an
unofficial fork not affiliated with or endorsed by the ZMK Project. It is
distributed under the same Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes made in this fork relative to the upstream ZMK Studio include:
  - Trackball settings tab (per-layer/axis behavior + auto mouse/temp layer,
    live-edited over a custom BLE GATT service)
  - Trackpad settings tab (live-edited over BLE)
  - Macros tab (NVS-backed dynamic macros, live-edited over BLE; import from
    keymap.keymap)
  - Combos tab (NVS-backed dynamic combos, live-edited over BLE)
  - Encoder and LED settings tabs (live-edited over BLE)
  - Firmware-capability discovery to show only the tabs a given build supports
  - Backup/restore, including keymap.keymap export
  - Japanese / English UI (i18n)
  - Native BLE/serial transport additions in the Tauri backend
